ltivitamin with iron\n- **Monitoring**: Weekly prealbumin (goal >20 mg/dL), weekly weights, calorie counts\n- Dietitian consultation for meal planning; oral supplements between meals\n\n**5. Respiratory Rehabilitation**:\n- Incentive spirometry 10 repetitions every hour while awake\n- Progressive aerobic conditioning (recumbent bike, walking program)\n- Chest wall stretching to prevent restrictive defect from anterior chest scarring\n\n**6. Functional Training**:\n- Progressive ADL training: feeding, grooming, dressing\n- Adaptive equipment as needed (built-up handles, long-handled devices)\n- Upper extremity strengthening program beginning with light resistance and progressing\n- Vocational assessment — carpentry requires full hand function; discuss timeline and alternatives',
